NOTE 1 — Trademark and design assets

The images bundled under `zhonggong-poster/assets/` — `zhonggong-logo.png` and the
mascot artwork in `assets/xiaolu/` — are trademark and design assets of their
respective owner (广东中公教育). They are NOT covered by the MIT License above.
They are included solely so the rendering engine can produce compliant output, and
may only be used for the owner's own promotional materials. Do not extract,
redistribute, resell, or repurpose them separately.

NOTE 2 — Fonts

The source code references commercial CJK fonts by filename (方正 / 站酷 / 庞门正道
families). No font files are bundled in this repository. Users are responsible
for obtaining their own licenses for any font they load.
